    'ws.lead':                        '"At first, I thought traditional banks were automatically the best choice. Until I realized that fees were eating up a significant portion of my small investments."',
    'ws.p1':                          'At first, I was investing with RBC and other traditional financial institutions. Honestly, I didn\'t really know the differences between brokerage platforms at the time. In my mind, "real banks" were automatically the best choice.',
    'ws.p2':                          'Over time, I realized there were often <strong>transaction fees</strong>. And when you start investing with small amounts, those fees can become very discouraging.',
    'ws.h2.fees':                     'The problem with fees on small amounts',
