    'fu.step4.title':       'Invest everything else',
    'fu.step4.desc':        'TFSA → QQC.F → compound interest → financial freedom. Invested money — forget it.',
    'fu.h2.mental':         'The mental key',
    'fu.p5':                'The real secret is <strong>mental separation</strong>. Invested money doesn\'t exist. It\'s not there to pay for an emergency, go on a trip, or buy something. It\'s working — and you let it work.',
    'fu.p6':                'Having a solid emergency fund is what allows you to never panic when markets drop. You don\'t need to sell. You let the money recover — and keep growing.',
